flowchart LR
    N[NDCI\n0.40] --> S[Weighted base score]
    T[NDTI\n0.25] --> S
    V[Shoreline NDVI\n0.10] --> S
    M[MNDWI floor\n0.10] --> S
    W[NDWI floor\n0.15] --> S
    S --> E[+ bounded field evidence]
    E --> C[Clamp to 0–1]
    C --> L{Risk band}
    L -->|0.00–0.32| Low[LOW\nRoutine]
    L -->|0.33–0.65| Med[MEDIUM\nRoutine / Elevated]
    L -->|0.66–1.00| High[HIGH\nElevated / Immediate]

